Package: entomology
Type: Package
Title: Simple Teaching Functions for the Flea Beetles Data
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person(given = "OpenAI", family = "Assistant", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "example@example.com")
Description: Teaching-oriented helper functions for simple calculations on a flea beetles dataset.
    The package includes the beetle data used in an introductory biostatistics example
    and provides small, readable functions for summaries, transformations, and a simple
    nearest-centroid classifier.
